OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FVariable amounts of cloud and
OL,6,Fsome bright or sunny spells and just a
OL,7,Ffew passing showers. Fresh
OL,8,Fsouthwesterly winds, occasionally
OL,9,Fstrong at first this morning.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FMainly dry this evening and
OL,12,Fovernight with clear periods. Chance
OL,13,Fof a few brief showers, these mostly
OL,14,Ffor Shetland. Windy with fresh to
OL,15,Fstrong southerly winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
