OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CSunday:FAfter a dry start rain,
OL,6,Foccasionally heavy, will spread
OL,7,Fnortheast during the afternoon and
OL,8,Fclear during the evening. Strong
OL,9,Foccasionally gale south or
OL,10,Fsouthwesterly winds.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FSunny
OL,13,Fspells and the odd shower on Monday,
OL,14,Ffresh southwesterly winds. Dry on
OL,15,FTuesday, strong to gale southeasterly
OL,16,Fwinds. Rain spreading northeast for a
OL,17,Ftime on Wednesday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
